  unitName: Fire Rod Limera
  unitId: 10794
  unitNumber: 1200
  description: The daughter of Reed and Lucana, two of the heroes who led the Great
    Escape. Wishing to serve the people like her parents once had, Limera began studying
    magic from an early age. Bearing witness to the rising political turmoil in the
    new promised land of Elgaia, Limera expected her heroic parents to take control
    of the situation. However, she would soon find out that their only intention
    was to help the common folk. Disappointed in her parents, she stormed off her
    home and enlisted in the provisional government's army.
  summonDesc: Your my commanding officer?<br>Nice to meet you!<br>Looking forward
    to fighting with you!
  fusionDesc: Hmm, interesting technique!<br>I can feel my power rising!<br>I could
    use some more of this!
